<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  v1.8.0 (PROD-READINESS-P3-P0-#3 partial): Tamil translations
  for the most user-facing strings. ~30 of the 354 strings in
  values/strings.xml are translated; the rest fall back to
  English (Android's default behaviour when a translation is
  missing for a key).

  The Tamil strings below are reviewed by the author. The
  translations aim for the formal register used in Tamil Nadu
  government documents; the user can change to the local
  dialect at a later release.

  Keys that have no Tamil equivalent (e.g. "Veedu" — kept as
  the product name; "SQLCipher" — kept as a technical term) are
  left as-is.
-->
